  m_text: "Long press the \"SPIN button\" \nto set the number of rounds \nfor automatic
    rotation,\nor automatic continuous \nexecution of bets. Click the \n\"Rotate\"
    button to start auto \nplay. Click Stop to interrupt \nthe automatic rotation.\nDuring
    automatic rotation, \nthe remaining number of \nrotations will be displayed \non
    the screen. \u221E means \nunlimited automatic rotation."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
