  m_text: 'Click the "acceleration button" to control the scrolling speed of the
    reels in the game, and its settings are divided into three gears: [normal spin,
    extreme speed spin, skip screen]

    "Normal Spin" reels spin the game at a
    normal speed.

    "Extreme Speed Spin" reel can accelerate the rotation in a
    short time to introduce the function and end the screen.

    "skip screen" reel
    can directly skip the function introduction and end the screen in a short time.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9d8ed5b04c17b48218ae193b213fb2a2, type: 2}
