  m_text: "\u2022 <indent=6%>Set the betting level amount; the spin cost varies according
    to the selected value.</indent>\n\u2022 <indent=6%>Set the number of betting
    lines; when the game starts, the maximum number of lines is selected by default.</indent>\n\u2022
    <indent=6%>To rotate, click the SPIN button to play.</indent>\n\u2022 <indent=6%>Any
    bonuses and special symbols are described in detail in the paytable.</indent>"
